        "brief": "You're on an authorised exercise at Quayholt Insurance, a fictional company. A colleague, Ayaan, clicked a convincing email and signed in, and now his account is being used. You're covering his inbox at the kiosk. Some of what turns up is a real sign that something is wrong, and some is ordinary. Sort it, and report or check anything that doesn't sit right. Reporting when you're unsure is always fine and never marked down.",
